OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers describe fight for funding
OL,4,Aas 'fastest finger first'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA five-generation farming family said
OL,7,Fthat they are "disappointed" and
OL,8,F"dumbfounded" to have missed out on
OL,9,Fvital government funding.
OL,11,FApplications for the #233m Sustainable
OL,12,FFarming Incentive (SFI) funding for
OL,13,FEngland closed in under six hours,
OL,14,Fmeaning some farmers like Dan Morris
OL,15,Fand his daughter Imogen had their
OL,16,Fapplications rejected.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
