OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers describe fight for funding
OL,4,Aas 'fastest finger first'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There is a fundamental lack of
OL,7,Funderstanding by the current government
OL,8,Fas to how farms run and operate",
OL,9,FMorris said, adding that the funding
OL,10,Fwindow was run like a "fastest finger
OL,11,Ffirst competition".
OL,13,FIn a statement, Farming Minister
OL,14,FStephen Morgan said he is "determined
OL,15,Fto work closely with farmers as we
OL,16,Flearn lessons from this year."
